+## 5. Finding 5 — draft registration validation removed with no replacement
+
+**Repair.** `protected-win validate --draft`. `draft_snapshot` writes the working tree into a
+throwaway index via `GIT_INDEX_FILE` — the real index is untouched — and `commit-tree`s it onto HEAD.
+The result is a dangling commit: no branch, no ref, nothing published, nothing on disk changed. It
+is a real, nameable candidate, so root binding and content identity both hold against it and the
+entire validator runs unmodified. No gate is softened and no other ref is certified: `--draft`
+refuses outright when combined with an explicitly named `--ref` that is not HEAD.
