+| `test_the_printed_replay_map_carries_a_CONCRETE_recorded_by_in_ONE_argv_token` | `BumpCandidateIdentityTest` | `shlex.split` of the printed line yields the identity as ONE token, equal to `recorded_by_identity(repo)` (a round-trip against the resolver, not a hardcoded address), and free of `$`, `%`, backtick, `<`, `>` — an unexpanded expansion would be recorded as a person |
