+  (`$USER`, then `$USERNAME` — the Windows spelling, since this block is pasted in Git Bash on this
+  box). It ends in a REFUSAL rather than the Python resolver's `unknown-operator` constant, because
+  a shell that cannot name the operator must not write the ledger.
