+#### What a build-identity receipt proves, exactly — and what it does not
+
+This is the identity contract. Read it before you treat a green `judge` as a statement about a
+binary. **It is not a reproducible-build claim and not a hermetic-build claim.** Nothing here lets
+you rebuild these bytes on another machine and get the same bytes, and nothing here detects a
+change made outside the list below.
