+- **libraries elsewhere on the loader path** — `PATH`, `%SystemRoot%\System32`, side-by-side
+  assemblies. Only the judge binary's own directory is hashed;
+- **git-ignored files inside the checkout** — they are excluded from the source identity, so an
+  ignored generated header that the build reads is invisible to it;
