+  written. Nothing of theirs reaches the object store.
+- **Tracked modifications and deletions are included automatically** (`git add -u`), which is the
+  editing workflow `--draft` exists for. There is no `git add -A` anywhere in this path.
+- **Git-ignored files are neither included nor a refusal.** Your build directory and your models do
+  not need authorising.
+- **A genuinely new candidate file is included only when you name it**, one flag per path, each of
+  which must exist, be untracked, and be under 1 MiB:
